["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/hasHost", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The `from` Build was run on the `to` Element during a LifecycleScopeType period (e.g. the host that the build runs on).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
